/8286123abbd3e66fbc35ed4a865ee43d.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A spiky trap. Don't touch!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/0c0c7eed4c6994cf08f45832b2d07d78.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/0c0c7eed4c6994cf08f45832b2d07d78.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/0c0c7eed4c6994cf08f45832b2d07d78.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is there more to discover?</h2>Sure there is, just look.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/54c37433803a97963fb224e8b294b2ce.webp?t=1705088457\" width=268 height=62 /></span><br>A selection of useful gadgets awaits you. If you have enough money of course.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/c0b3cbb8bf4cbe144dc7894f2b0925b1.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/c0b3cbb8bf4cbe144dc7894f2b0925b1.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/c0b3cbb8bf4cbe144dc7894f2b0925b1.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fly around like a bird and attack from above, with the jetpack. Just like a bird does...?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e9b1d316e3aea265a11b36f0015a64c0.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e9b1d316e3aea265a11b36f0015a64c0.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e9b1d316e3aea265a11b36f0015a64c0.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Protect yourself with a helmet and shield.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/1d411b1ff62ff4ee176517d15738dd0f.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/1d411b1ff62ff4ee176517d15738dd0f.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/1d411b1ff62ff4ee176517d15738dd0f.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >That sounds good. But what about weapons?</h2>Glad you ask!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e0900add27bf76fe2eb3c646560f9d2a.webp?t=1705088457\" width=331 height=62 /></span><br>Here is a selection of weapons in Pavephobia. Don't worry, there will be more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/93e99eda0a54a3b358667c1d0dab6c6b.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/93e99eda0a54a3b358667c1d0dab6c6b.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/93e99eda0a54a3b358667c1d0dab6c6b.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The standard sword. Sharp as a...sword.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/713f9af6fb7195cef2e2819a7da7ce2b.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/713f9af6fb7195cef2e2819a7da7ce2b.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/713f9af6fb7195cef2e2819a7da7ce2b.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Grenades too, of course! What else?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e98ab8092112db4ba7089fdc5cfa0dd3.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e98ab8092112db4ba7089fdc5cfa0dd3.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e98ab8092112db4ba7089fdc5cfa0dd3.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And now?</h2>Add it to your wishlist or buy it. <br>Or join the Steam Community Hub and meet some other Pavephobians.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/a9f63183f37dacd57ca51b3860332241.avif?t=1705088457\" width=460 height=92 /></span><br><br>and don't forget to add it to your wishlist...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: